title: Reject refund of a blocked asset account

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet_assets::refund` did not check the account status, so the holder of a blocked
    account could call it with `allow_burn` and burn their whole balance, remove the account
    entry together with its `Blocked` status, and receive the asset again afterwards. A blocked
    account is meant to neither send nor receive, and `refund_other` already rejected it.
    `refund` now fails with `Frozen` while the account is blocked, matching `refund_other`.
    Refunding a frozen account is unchanged.

crates:
- name: pallet-assets
  bump: patch
